Here the list of bug fixes:

-Add key map option in command menu. Now it's possible to remap keyboard commands.

-Change the default keyboard and mouse input to control the player:
Movement = WASD;
Jump = Space;
Attack = Left Mouse Button;
Spell = Right Mouse Button;
Roll = Shift
Parry = Q
Interaction = E
Change Spell = Mouse scroll

-Change enemy collisions;

-Minor bug fixes;
